  note    `iat` in the future past the leeway is refused, as PyJWT does and golang-jwt does with `WithIssuedAt`

capability jwt/issuer-audience-subject  `iss`, `aud` and `sub` held to what the verifier expects
  heroes  jose.check_claims, jose.Rules
